Hi Tianhua,

Thanks for your question! This error message pops up when the ldsc function is unable to find the location of your ld-score files, in your case "barley_ld/". The way you have the code written,  those ld-score files would need to be a subdirectory within the working directory where your .sumstats.gz files are stored. Alternatively, you could write the specific path name to where the ld-score files are (e.g., "~/Tianhua/Documents/barley_ld/". Let me know if this helps or if you have anymore questions!

-Andrew

